## Deviation statement (added 2026-11-05)

Implementation pre-existed; genuine RED evidence cannot be reconstructed retroactively. Tests are regression guards, not TDD RED evidence. Marking unverified, not fabricating, per tdd-guardian "absence → unverified, never violation" policy.
